From 737c5220e92da2d41aefbbe16e4c7cd949ca9e8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Feb 2026 02:00:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix production bugs and Play Store compliance issues

Bug fixes:
- Fix profile.tsx: colors.isDark doesn't exist on colors object (always evaluated wrong)
- Fix waiver.tsx: was using static dark theme import instead of ThemeContext
  (waiver screen was always dark even in light mode)
- Fix onboarding.tsx: same static dark theme bug as waiver
- Fix onboarding text: said '15+ peptides' but app has 29 peptides + 20 meds

Play Store compliance:
- Add Privacy Policy and Terms of Service links to Profile screen
- Add Delete Account button for cloud users (Google Play requirement since Nov 2023)
- Add /auth/delete-account API endpoint that purges all user data
- Register privacy-policy route in navigation stack

Production hardening:
- Add MongoDB indexes on startup (user_id, session_token, etc.)
- Add TTL index on user_sessions.expires_at for auto-cleanup
- Fix clearData to also clear recurring items, custom entries, favorites

Developer tooling:
- Add validate-publish.js pre-flight check script
- Add setup-and-publish.sh one-command setup/build script
